# Movie Analytics Dashboard

## Overview
Developed an end-to-end Movie Analytics Dashboard using the Al Pacino Movies Dataset. The project demonstrates data storage, data analysis, and dashboard creation using MySQL, Python, and Power BI.

## Technologies Used
- MySQL Workbench
- Python
- Pandas
- SQLAlchemy
- PyMySQL
- Matplotlib & Seaborn
- Power BI

## Implementation
- Imported CSV data into MySQL.
- Connected Python with MySQL.
- Retrieved and analyzed data using Pandas.
- Cleaned and transformed data for analysis.
- Generated insights on movies, genres, directors, ratings, and countries.
- Built an interactive dashboard in Power BI.

## Key Analysis
- Movies vs Series Distribution
- Top Genres
- Top Directors
- Country-wise Analysis
- Rating and Metascore Analysis
- Top Rated Movies
- Release Trend Analysis

## Dashboard Features
- Total Movies KPI
- Average Rating KPI
- Maximum & Minimum Rating KPI
- Genre Analysis
- Director Analysis
- Country Distribution
- Interactive Filters and Slicers

## Outcome
Successfully created an interactive Movie Analytics Dashboard that provides insights into movie ratings, genres, directors, countries, and release trends through data visualization and reporting.
